\" default=\"高亮色调\"}，营造出微妙的视觉节奏感\n\n产品呈现： 仅产品，混合俯视和 45 度角拍摄，简约石板陶瓷餐具摆盘，极致新鲜感\n\n色调策略： 同色系 - 核心产品色调与背景色调和谐统一，营造出飘逸的融合感\n\n主要元素： 分解式{argument name=\"product_name\"}展示 - 包括主品、细节特写、核心食材点缀、搭配的小食/装饰、以及半成品剖面，每款均置于配套的极简餐具中，保持柔和一致的灯光\n\n字体： 双语 - 英文名称采用优雅的浅色衬线字体 (Didot)，下方为简洁的无衬线英文/中文/韩文，小段产地或食材描述为浅灰色\n\n相机： Canon EOS R5，100mm 微距镜头用于捕捉材质纹理，50mm 镜头用于拍摄完整盘装，柔和漫射的顶部照明，侧面边缘照明增强立体感\n\n风格： 简约 + 奢华混合 - 大量留白（Negative Space），精致字体，{argument name=\"color_2\"} 作为主要视觉基调\n\n风格关键字： {argument name=\"product_name\"}，品尝菜单，同色系，奢华，网页设计，极简主义\n\n签名： 右下角以小字优雅地放置着精致的手写签名{prompt2}。\n1"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "ttN text", "properties": {"ttNnodeVersion": "1.0.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ttN text"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [31], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "links": [32], "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [274.080078125, 314], "pos": [-940.3565063476562, 777.2470703125], "widgets_values": ["7cbc91c4e728281e93b619d9cedf87b772c80eac46b5a0d12af5b6d7fff19ee9.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 21, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [28], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [356.044677734375, 111.2598876953125], "pos": [-689.6248168945312, 1385.989501953125], "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, 